{"id":100,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"カトリック精神で知性と奉仕の心を育む","feature_description":"南山中学校・高等学校は、カトリック精神に基づき、知性と豊かな人間性を育てる学校です。男子部・女子部それぞれの教育環境の中で、学力、礼節、他者に奉仕する心を大切にしています。授業や学校生活を通して、自分を磨き、社会に貢献する姿勢を身に付けることを目指します。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに、教育方針や学校生活を整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":1636,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nanzan-girls.ed.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1637,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nanzan-girls.ed.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1638,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nanzan-girls.ed.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1639,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nanzan-girls.ed.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1640,"name":"スキー・スノーボード部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nanzan-girls.ed.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1641,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nanzan-girls.ed.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1642,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nanzan-girls.ed.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1643,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.nanzan-girls.ed.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1644,"name":"カトリック研究部（パイプオルガンの会）","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.nanzan-girls.ed.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1645,"name":"手芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.nanzan-girls.ed.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1646,"name":"割烹部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.nanzan-girls.ed.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1647,"name":"地歴部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.nanzan-girls.ed.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1648,"name":"